Postman  →  POST /api/v1/files/upload
              ↓
         multer (memoryStorage) reads the file into req.file.buffer
              ↓
         storageService.upload(req.file, 'asset-images')
              ↓
         MinIOProvider → PutObjectCommand → localhost:9000/assets/asset-images/<uuid>.jpg
              ↓
         returns { fileKey, url, size, mimeType }